---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Front Desk Discovery
description: A short, honest checkup on where your calls, messages and hours are going. Tap through it in pieces, it saves as you go, and you get a straight answer on whether 406 Front Desk can help or not.
pageCss: build-brief
permalink: /discovery/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
noindex: true   # sent by hand to a warm lead; not a marketing page until Gus says so
---
{#
  Front Desk Discovery: the self-serve deployment of the Problem-Discovery Questionnaire
  (vault: wiki/synthesis/406 Front Desk — Problem-Discovery Questionnaire).

  WHO THIS IS FOR: an owner who is underwater. The emailed open-question version of this
  went unanswered for nine weeks (2026-07-12), so the design rules are:
    - only step 1 is required; every later step can be skipped, and "send what you have"
      is on every step. Permission to stop matters more than save-and-resume.
    - mostly taps; every "in your own words" box is optional.
    - it saves on this device as they go, and can hand them a private link to carry on
      from another device. Nothing is sent, to anyone, until they hit send.
    - on send they get an honest fit verdict, including "this isn't me" when it isn't.

  QUESTIONS live in src/_data/discovery.json. FIELD IDS are generated
  (scripts/sync-discovery.mjs). THE VERDICT RULES live in
  netlify/functions/discovery-verdict.mjs and are selftested; this page only renders
  what the server sends back, so there is exactly one copy of the rules.

  NO PHONE FIELD, NO A2P CONSENT BLOCK: same call as /start/ (2026-08-03).
  The page chrome and form controls reuse build-brief.css on purpose.
#}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/discovery.css?v={{ buildStamp }}" />

<div class="header-band">
  <span class="header-eyebrow">Front desk discovery</span>
  <h1>Can I actually help you?</h1>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="bb-intro" id="dvIntro">
    <p>
      This is how I find out where your time and your customers are getting away from you, and whether
      any of it is something I can fix. About {{ discovery.minutes }} minutes of mostly tapping, and you get a straight
      answer at the end, including <strong>"this isn't me"</strong> if it isn't.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Do it in pieces.</strong> It saves on this device as you go, so close the tab mid-thought and
      come back to the same link later. Only the first step is required. After that, skip anything, and
      send what you have whenever you run out of time. Nothing goes anywhere until you hit send.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="dv-resume" id="dvResume" hidden role="status"></div>

  <ol class="bb-rail" id="bbRail" aria-label="Progress">
    {% for s in discovery.steps %}
    <li class="bb-rail__step" data-step="{{ s.n }}"><span class="bb-rail__n">{{ s.n }}</span><span class="bb-rail__t">{{ s.title }}</span></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>

  <form id="dvForm" class="bb-form" novalidate autocomplete="on">
    {# Honeypot. A real person never fills this; bots fill everything. #}
    <div class="bb-hp" aria-hidden="true">
      <label>Company website<input type="text" name="website_hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label>
    </div>

    {% set total = discovery.steps | length %}
    {% for s in discovery.steps %}
    <fieldset class="bb-step" data-step="{{ s.n }}" {% if s.n != 1 %}hidden{% endif %}>
      <legend class="bb-step__legend">
        <span class="bb-step__count">Step {{ s.n }} of {{ total }}{% if s.n > 1 %} · optional{% endif %}</span>
        <span class="bb-step__title">{{ s.title }}</span>
      </legend>
      <p class="bb-step__blurb">{{ s.blurb }}</p>

      {% for q in s.questions %}
      <div class="bb-field{% if q.kind == 'note' %} dv-note{% endif %}" data-q="{{ q.id }}"
           {% if q.showIf %}data-show-q="{{ q.showIf.q }}" data-show-has="{{ q.showIf.has }}" hidden{% endif %}>
        {% if q.kind == "note" %}
          <p>{{ q.text }}</p>
        {% else %}
          {% if q.kind == "chips" or q.kind == "multi" %}
            <span class="bb-label" id="l_{{ q.id }}">{{ q.label }}{% if q.required %} <span class="bb-req">required</span>{% endif %}</span>
          {% else %}
            <label class="bb-label" for="f_{{ q.id }}">{{ q.label }}{% if q.required %} <span class="bb-req">required</span>{% endif %}</label>
          {% endif %}
          {% if q.help %}<p class="bb-help">{{ q.help }}</p>{% endif %}

          {% if q.kind == "chips" %}
            <div class="bb-options dv-chips" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="l_{{ q.id }}">
              {% for o in q.options %}
              <label class="bb-option"><input type="radio" name="{{ q.id }}" value="{{ o }}" {% if q.required %}required{% endif %} /><span>{{ o }}</span></label>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          {% elif q.kind == "multi" %}
            <div class="bb-options bb-options--multi" role="group" aria-labelledby="l_{{ q.id }}" data-multi="1"{% if q.max %} data-max="{{ q.max }}"{% endif %}>
              {% for o in q.options %}
              <label class="bb-option"><input type="checkbox" name="{{ q.id }}" value="{{ o }}" /><span>{{ o }}</span></label>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
            {% if q.max %}<p class="bb-count" data-max="{{ q.max }}"></p>{% endif %}
          {% elif q.kind == "longtext" %}
            <textarea class="bb-input bb-textarea" id="f_{{ q.id }}" name="{{ q.id }}" rows="3" maxlength="3000" {% if q.required %}required{% endif %}></textarea>
          {% elif q.kind == "number" %}
            <input class="bb-input dv-number" type="text" inputmode="decimal" id="f_{{ q.id }}" name="{{ q.id }}" maxlength="20" />
          {% else %}
            <input class="bb-input" type="{% if q.kind == 'email' %}email{% else %}text{% endif %}" id="f_{{ q.id }}" name="{{ q.id }}" maxlength="300"
                   {% if q.autocomplete %}autocomplete="{{ q.autocomplete }}"{% endif %} {% if q.required %}required{% endif %} />
          {% endif %}

          {% if q.own %}
          <details class="dv-own">
            <summary>{{ q.ownLabel or "In your own words (optional)" }}</summary>
            <textarea class="bb-input bb-textarea" name="{{ q.id }}__own" rows="2" maxlength="1500" aria-label="{{ q.label }}, in your own words"></textarea>
          </details>
          {% endif %}
          <p class="bb-error" hidden>This one's needed before the next step.</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endfor %}

      <div class="bb-nav">
        <button type="button" class="bb-btn bb-btn--ghost" data-back {% if s.n == 1 %}hidden{% endif %}>Back</button>
        {% if s.n < total %}
        <button type="button" class="bb-btn" data-next>{% if s.n == 1 %}Next step{% else %}Next (or skip){% endif %}</button>
        {% else %}
        <button type="submit" class="bb-btn bb-btn--go" data-send>Send it and show me the verdict</button>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      {% if s.n > 1 and s.n < total %}
      <p class="dv-early">Out of time? <button type="submit" class="dv-linkbtn" data-send>Send what you have</button> and I'll work with that.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </fieldset>
    {% endfor %}

    <div class="dv-carry" id="dvCarry">
      <button type="button" class="dv-linkbtn" id="dvCarryBtn">Finish on another device?</button>
      <div class="dv-carry__out" id="dvCarryOut" hidden></div>
    </div>

    <div class="bb-saved" id="bbSaved" hidden>Saved on this device</div>
  </form>

  <section class="dv-verdict" id="dvVerdict" hidden aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1"></section>
</div>

<script src="/js/discovery.js?v={{ buildStamp }}" defer></script>
